>Subject: Stuck on level 28
>  Right now I'm on the 28th level -- and I'm stuck.
>I can't get the drawbridge open.
.
i've been in the same situation myself. the oracle knows about this ...

you could find a musical instrument (excluding a drum) and play the
right tune while standing (on dry land) in front of the drawbridge.
you'll "hear" clues and you have to be a musical mastermind to play the
right tune unless the gods have favored you with it during the course
of prayer.

you could open the door with a wand of opening or a spell of knock.

you could float around the moat and enter the castle from the rear door
but be careful to levitate over the trapdoors in the rear corridor, also.
if you encounter an eel you better be able to kill it quickly since it
could conceivably pull you into the water.
.
